  "question": {
    "text": "The number of distinct real roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is",
